<Layout
  title={"Satiation Benchmark: Reference Harness, Adapters, and Telemetry Attribution"}
  description={"About: Fixed sequential Rust reference harness (Lane B), multi-shape adapter bridge (Shapes D, M, H, I), C1-C12 conformance suite, and rootless L0-L4 telemetry attribution verified on Apple M5 Max."}
>
  <section class="px-6 md:px-10 pt-16 md:pt-24 pb-20 max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <p class="section-label mb-4">Research study · draft · about</p>
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-brand-white tracking-tight">
      Satiation Benchmark: Reference Harness, Adapters, and Telemetry Attribution
    </h1>
    <p class="mt-6 font-body text-base text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
      This study specifies and empirically audits how diverse models and external coding agents take an identical fixed benchmark without conflating model capability with wrapper policy or conflating shared-host counters with physical rail joules. It pairs a deterministic Rust reference harness (`Lane B`) and a single loopback proxy bridge (`Shapes D, M, H, I`) with a twelve-check conformance suite (`C1`–`C12`) and a five-level rootless telemetry engine (`L0`–`L4` crossed with attribution labels `A1`–`N`).
    </p>
    <div class="mt-8 glass-card p-6">
      <p class="font-mono text-[10px] tracking-[2px] uppercase text-brand-gray mb-3">What the study claims and what it does not</p>
      <ol class="list-decimal pl-5 space-y-2 font-body text-sm text-brand-slate leading-relaxed">
        <li>Harness determinism and `C1`–`C12` conformance: all 12 Rust reference and OS confinement checks pass on Apple M5 Max, including zero-byte-diff multi-turn replay under `ContextRule_v0` (80% window oldest-tool-output elision with zero compaction model calls) and `Truncate_v0` (`8 + 8 KiB`), `2.073 ms` mean process-group `SIGKILL` cleanup (`< 2,000 ms` ceiling), and `24/24` plus `6/6` multi-file repository completion parity between `Lane B` and `Shape H` (`Claude Code 2.1.330`, clearing `Falsifier 8` at `1.67×–3.44×` lower prompt+cache token volume).</li>
        <li>Empirical cloud non-determinism (`C12`): across 32 live `satb-proxy` calls (`8` identical requests per endpoint), `Anthropic claude-opus-5-5` and `claude-sonnet-5-5` reject `temperature = 0.0` with `HTTP 400` deprecation and emit `8/8` distinct raw outputs (`4` and `2` distinct algebraic identities), `Cerebras gpt-oss-120b` (`temperature = 0.0, seed = 42`) emits `2/8` distinct outputs, and `xAI grok-4.20-0309-non-reasoning` emits `1/8` algebraic identity with `8/8` distinct explanations — whereas local `Shape D` (`dnull`) emits `1/8` bit-identical digest.</li>
        <li>Observer-effect, `B`-vs-`C` attribution, and `188`-window drift falsifiers: boundary-only `proc_pid_rusage` reads draw `0.011 mW` (`108 µJ` over `10 s`) vs. `66.44 mW` (`0.177%` of `L2` window) at the `100 ms` reference tick; `Step 7` sum checks hold within `<= 1 µJ` (`3/3`), whereas `CPU`-proportional (`Kepler`, label `C`) splitting diverges from sequential temporal boundary counters (`B`) by `32.59%–35.86%` on shared `L2` (`Falsifier 3`); and across `188` shared-host `L2` windows, `Falsifier 6` cleanly invalidates `124` drifted net-above-idle subtractions while preserving `100%` of raw `L2` and `L3` `reported_j` channels.</li>
        <li>Not claimed: external wall-plug (`L0`) or physical board shunt (`INA238`/`INA3221`) readings (`board_metered = false`, `measured_j = None`; Apple M5 Max figures are rootless `IOReport` and `proc_pid_rusage` `reported_j` counters), closed-API server energy (`not_available`, label `N`; fleet sustainability medians never enter receipts), or on-device verification of `NVIDIA Jetson Thor` `INA3221 ch3`/`NVML` and `Framework AMD` `RAPL`/`amdgpu` domains.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

